  m_Text: "<b>Thermo-Tactics</b> \u2014 a capstone project: a turn-based strategy
    game about keeping the planet below 1.5 \xB0C, set in the Philippines.\n\n<b>Team</b>\nEdz
    Steinar Bederico \xB7 Jon Francis Gellido \xB7 Rodge Emanuel Ramos \xB7 Jherwin
    Reyes\n\n<b>Fonts</b>\nPixelify Sans and Atkinson Hyperlegible, SIL Open Font
    License 1.1\n\n<b>Music</b> (from chosic.com, used with credit)\n\"Superepic\"
    by Alexander Nakarada (CC BY 4.0) \xB7 \"Warfare\" by MaxKoMusic (CC BY-SA 3.0)
    \xB7 \"Thunder Unison\" by Keys of Moon (CC BY 4.0)\n\n<b>Sound effects</b>\nPixabay
    (Pixabay Content License): freesound_community, freesoundeffects, alphix, puyopuyomegafan1234\n\nMade
    with Unity 6. Results and progress are stored only on this device (SQLite)."
